{"id": 8990271242403, "title": "Medicube Hypochlorous Acid Daily Facial Spray ( 125ml )", "body_html": "<p data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0\">The <b data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"40\">Medicube Hypochlorous Acid Daily Facial Spray</b> is a professional-grade clinical mist designed to provide immediate relief for stressed, reactive, and acne-prone skin. Formulated with pure Hypochlorous Acid, this 125ml spray works to neutralize harmful bacteria and soothe inflammation on contact. It is the ultimate \"skin first aid\" solution for those looking to calm redness, manage \"maskne,\" and maintain a clear, balanced complexion throughout the day.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2,1,1\">This high-performance facial spray features a lightweight, non-irritating formula that mimics the body\u2019s natural immune response to promote rapid skin healing. Ideal for the South African climate, it provides a refreshing layer of protection against environmental pollutants and sweat. By incorporating this clinical innovation into your daily routine, you can enjoy a visibly calmer, smoother, and more resilient complexion with professional-grade results.</p>", "vendor": "K Beauty ", "product_type": "", "created_at": "2026-01-14T15:53:17+02:00", "handle": "medicube-hypochlorous-acid-daily-facial-spray-125ml", "updated_at": "2026-09-21T20:58:39+02:00", "published_at": "2026-01-16T09:10:22+02:00", "template_suffix": "", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "", "variants": [{"id": 46766296989859, "product_id": 8990271242403, "title": "Default Title", "price": "499.00", "sku": "MD-1049", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": "shopify", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2026-01-14T15:53:17+02:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-21T20:58:39+02:00", "taxable": false, "barcode": "8800289474682", "grams": 0, "image_id": null, "weight": 0.0, "weight_unit": "kg", "requires_shipping": true, "quantity_r